nteract/custom-themes-74","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#tokens","content":"Typeface"},"510":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-75","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#tokens","content":"`--on-accent` should contrast with `--primary`. Light accents need a dark `--on-accent`; dark accents need a light one. JS will recompute `--on-accent` when a global `themeColor` or per-option `color` is applied."},"511":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-76","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#tokens","content":"Root `font-size` is `1vh`, so `1rem` is 1% of the viewport height. Size the E key and rows in `rem`, not `px`. Offset the list from the key with `--options-x` on `#options-wrapper` (default `2.6rem`)."},"512":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-77","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"Copy `web/themes/modern.css` or `web/themes/minimal.css` and rename `[data-theme=\"...\"]`. At minimum, cover:"},"513":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-78","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"**`#interact-container` / `#interact-key`** — size, border, background, letter"},"514":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-79","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"**`#interact-progress`** — usually `left/right/bottom: 0; width: 100%; height: 0` with `background: rgb(var(--primary))`. JS only changes `height`."},"515":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-80","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"**`.option-container`** — row chrome"},"516":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-81","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"**`.option-container.highlighted`** — selected row. Put `--primary` here, not on every idle row."},"517":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-82","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"**`.option-icon`, `.option-label`, `.option-hold`** — idle and `.highlighted` colors"},"518":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-83","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"**`body.is-cooldown`** — dim the key so the hourglass reads as blocked"},"519":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-84","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#what-to-style","content":"`.animated-background` is a full-row fill used by `legacy` and `retro`. Most themes hide it with `display: none`."},"520":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-85","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#compact-interact","content":"When compact, global CSS strips border, background, and shadow from `.interact-summary` and draws `INTERACT` as uppercase outlined type. Keep row decorations on `.option-container` only. Pseudos on `.interact-summary` will still show on the compact label."},"521":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-86","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#compact-interact","content":"To force compact label color (light themes need this so it stays white):"},"522":{"id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes-87","page_id":"/docs/interact/custom-themes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/custom-themes#hold-contrast","content":"While holding, the letter keeps its idle color and gets a `--on-accent` stroke so it stays re